[00:40.42]Loyal love! God is love.
[00:47.04]We can sense his care from above.
[00:53.83]God by means of his precious Son
[00:59.58]Paid the ransom for ev’ryone,
[01:07.92]Giving hope that we might possess
[01:13.60]Life eternal and happiness.
[01:21.63](Chorus)
[01:21.78]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[01:28.08]Come and drink life’s water free.
[01:35.16]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[01:42.33]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[01:57.08]Loyal love! God is love.
[02:03.52]All his works give proof of his love.
[02:10.25]Love Jehovah has further shown,
[02:17.28]Giving Jesus the kingly throne.
[02:24.34]God’s own purpose has come to pass.
[02:30.74]See! His Kingdom is here at last!
[02:38.15](Chorus)
[02:38.30]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[02:45.04]Come and drink life’s water free.
[02:51.71]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[02:59.16]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
[03:09.47]Loyal love! God is love.
[03:16.28]May his spirit move us to love.
[03:23.22]As we loyally help the meek,
[03:30.38]God’s commandments they learn to keep.
[03:37.28]We are serving with godly fear,
[03:44.28]Preaching boldly for all to hear.
[03:51.13](Chorus)
[03:51.28]Hey there, all you thirsty ones,
[03:58.34]Come and drink life’s water free.
[04:04.98]Yes, come drink, you thirsty ones;
[04:17.06]God’s loyal love you’ll see.
